WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.520 --> 00:00:05.080
and with just days left before Republicans
regained control of the house house Democrats

00:00:05.080 --> 00:00:10.720
released six years worth of former president
Donald Trump's tax returns the nearly 6 000

00:00:10.720 --> 00:00:16.129
pages of documents cap off a years-long battle
between the former president and Congress

00:00:16.129 --> 00:00:21.990
Scott McFarland reports from Washington six
years of former president Trump's tax returns

00:00:21.990 --> 00:00:29.640
reveal he paid 750 in federal income tax in
2016 and 2017 and nothing in 2020 claiming

00:00:29.640 --> 00:00:36.309
more business losses than earnings how is
he in a position to pay so little some years

00:00:36.309 --> 00:00:41.300
less than you and me in income taxes it's
a great question look the tax code is is extremely

00:00:41.300 --> 00:00:46.129
complicated president Trump has utilized the
tax code to his Advantage Democrats went all

00:00:46.129 --> 00:00:50.489
the way to the Supreme Court to get their
hands on the returns after Trump defied Decades

00:00:50.489 --> 00:00:56.020
of tradition declining to release them voluntarily
as a candidate then as president Democrats

00:00:56.020 --> 00:01:01.090
publicly posted the documents four days before
they lose control of the U.S House the power

00:01:01.090 --> 00:01:08.310
of the presidency is so great and so unique
we need to make sure that that person regardless

00:01:08.310 --> 00:01:15.260
of party is above reproach the returns also
show zero charitable donations listed in 2020

00:01:15.260 --> 00:01:18.820
despite Trump's pledge to donate his four
hundred thousand dollar a year presidential

00:01:18.820 --> 00:01:23.340
salary to charity so we can't tell if he was
telling the truth when he said he was donating

00:01:23.340 --> 00:01:29.159
a salary or not but again upon IRS audit they
would ask for those kinds of documentation

00:01:29.159 --> 00:01:34.250
from the tax preparer but Democrats say the
returns revealed Trump wasn't audited by the

00:01:34.250 --> 00:01:39.740
IRS as he'd claimed and as it was expected
of the IRS during much of the presidency Trump

00:01:39.740 --> 00:01:44.909
in a recorded statement called the release
a political attack the seizure of these confidential

00:01:44.909 --> 00:01:50.990
records was completely unconstitutional there
is no legitimate legislative purpose for their

00:01:50.990 --> 00:01:59.100
action and if you look at what they've done
it's so sad for our country Republicans on

00:01:59.100 --> 00:02:03.040
the house Ways and Means Committee were also
critical of the release of the tax returns

00:02:03.040 --> 00:02:08.390
and they take control of the panel as Republicans
take control of the house Tuesday with the

00:02:08.390 --> 00:02:12.799
new Congress for CBS Saturday morning I'm
Scott McFarland in Washington

